n\n⚠️ Post \"https://lockin-ai.lockin.com/v1/chat/completions\": context deadline exceeded (Client.Timeout exceeded while awaiting headers)\n\n**温馨提示**：AI分析功能需要配置正确的API权限。\n\n', 'incident', 0.70, '{\"checkType\": \"performance\", \"targetName\": \"8.130.14.34\", \"targetType\": \"host\"}', 0, '', 2, '', '2026-01-12 12:33:54.739');
