tainerd.sock |\n| dnsmasq | 1958583 | 0.3 | 22.6 | mysqld --default-authentication-plugin=caching_sha2_password --character-set-server=utf8mb4 --collation-server=utf8mb4_unicode_ci |\n| root | 2047742 | 0.3 | 0.5 | /opt/agent/dodevops-agent |\n| mysql | 1269514 | 0.3 | 20.9 | /usr/sbin/mysqld |\n| root | 379517 | 0.2 | 3.0 | /usr/bin/dockerd -H fd:// --containerd=/run/containerd/containerd.sock |\n| root | 379334 | 0.1 | 1.7 | /usr/bin/containerd |\n| root | 2843811 | 0.1 | 2.3 | /app/devops |\n| root | 2609356 | 0.1 | 11.6 | /opt/netops/netops_linux/main |\n| dnsmasq | 2626797 | 0.1 | 0.1 | redis-server *:6379 |\n\n## 🤖 AI智能分析\n\n⚠️ Post \"https://lockin-ai.lockin.com/v1/chat/completions\": context deadline exceeded (Client.Timeout exceeded while awaiting headers)\n\n**温馨提示**：AI分析功能需要配置正确的API权限。\n\n', 'incident', 0.70, '{\"checkType\": \"performance\", \"targetName\": \"139.9.205.38\", \"targetType\": \"host\"}', 0, '', 2, '', '2026-01-12 14:11:50.821');
