INSERT INTO `ai_agent_chat_history` (`id`, `session_id`, `user_id`, `role`, `message`, `intent`, `intent_conf`, `entities`, `task_id`, `task_type`, `status`, `error_msg`, `create_time`) VALUES (289, '0ddc385e-33b9-44b4-a791-9dfbb1e3541b', 89, 'assistant', '# 服务安装结果\n\n- 主机: `百度云-ops (180.76.231.65)`\n- 服务: `nginx`\n- 系统: `ubuntu 22.04`\n- 现有状态: `installed`\n- 包管理器: `apt`\n- 安装结果: `skipped`\n- 启动结果: `start_failed`\n- 服务状态: `inactive`\n\n## 检查结论\n\n服务 `nginx` 未成功启动，请查看下方状态输出。\n\n### 失败原因\n\n- nginx 端口 `29` 被占用\n\n### 建议处理\n\n- 执行 `ss -lntp | grep :29` 查看占用该端口的进程\n- 确认占用进程后，再决定停掉旧服务或修改 nginx 的监听端口\n\n## 服务状态\n\n```plaintext\n× nginx.service - A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server\n     Loaded: loaded (/lib/systemd/system/nginx.service; enabled; vendor preset: enabled)\n     Active: failed (Result: exit-code) since Tue 2026-03-24 19:55:29 CST; 11ms ago\n       Docs: man:nginx(8)\n    Process: 3218264 ExecStartPre=/usr/sbin/nginx -t -q -g daemon on; master_process on; (code=exited, status=0/SUCCESS)\n    Process: 3218265 ExecStart=/usr/sbin/nginx -g daemon on; master_process on; (code=exited, status=1/FAILURE)\n        CPU: 28ms\n\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops systemd[1]: Starting A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server...\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:27 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:27 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:28 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:28 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] still could not bind()\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops systemd[1]: nginx.service: Control process exited, code=exited, status=1/FAILURE\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops systemd[1]: nginx.service: Failed with result \'exit-code\'.\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops systemd[1]: Failed to start A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server.\n```\n\n## 最近日志\n\n```plaintext\nMar 24 19:55:23 baidu-ops systemd[1]: Starting A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server...\nMar 24 19:55:23 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:24 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:24 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:25 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:25 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops nginx[3218235]: nginx: [emerg] still could not bind()\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops systemd[1]: nginx.service: Control process exited, code=exited, status=1/FAILURE\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops systemd[1]: nginx.service: Failed with result \'exit-code\'.\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops systemd[1]: Failed to start A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server.\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops systemd[1]: Starting A high performance web server and a reverse proxy server...\nMar 24 19:55:26 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:27 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:27 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:28 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:28 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] bind() to 0.0.0.0:80 failed (98: Unknown error)\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops nginx[3218265]: nginx: [emerg] still could not bind()\nMar 24 19:55:29 baidu-ops sys